<title>ESTONIA: RADIO HEADLINES - JULY 4.</title>
<headline>RADIO HEADLINES - JULY 4.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the main headlines from Estonia's Kuku radio news report on Friday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Some 75 percent of foreign direct investments in 1996 came to Tallinn and its surrounding region and this tendency is seen continuing, the investment agency said.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
